1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
<i>Previously, on the night shift...</i>

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Did anyone check the back door?
- I locked it myself.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,100
Then who opened it?

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,900
Nobody leaves this room
until we find out.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,300
2024

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,800
Note to self: never volunteer again.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,500
{\an8}[DOOR CREAKS]

8
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,000
<b>Stop!</b> Don't move.

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,700
The server error page
was a message for us.

10
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Then who opened it?

11
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,900
We have until sunrise to figure out
what is going on in this building.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,000
<i>To be continued.</i>
